</div><p class="dialog-lead">
In our traditional karate sessions, we instruct Wado-ryu karate, recognized as one of the four principal traditional karate styles, founded by Master Hironori Otsuka in the early 20th century. At Heiwase, practitioners are carefully grouped by age to optimally practice Wado karate techniques. Once you have established a strong foundation in basic techniques, you will progress to mastering the style's formal exercises, alongside an array of sparring and self-defense applications. You will receive formal recognition of your ongoing development through periodic belt examinations.
</p>
